  "design": {
    "idea": "Stepped T-Apse optical contraption: push the Blue Transformer onto the sunken cistern buoy in SUN and rotate it to 135 deg so the low sunbeam arms the elevation pin; flood in RAIN to lift and latch the buoy; return to SUN so the skylight beam bounces off the elevated mirror into the upper blue sensor!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "SUN -> RAIN -> SUN optical chain: buoy buoyancy elevates a mirror into a skylight beam.",
    "decisions": 10,
    "expert_s": 50,
    "reward": "ms_r4_open+35_shards",
    "why": "West Wing optical showpiece preparing players for the 3-season contraption in r8, with an apse Rain Frog guard and final SUN ignition latch.",
    "exit": "exit_ms_r4_north",
